
# Delete member @MEMBER_CODE@ from the Central Server -- reversal of
# 02-cs-members-member.hurl.tmpl (join-c plan Task 2). CONFIRMED LIVE
# (apps/join-api/tests/fixtures/xroad/unjoin.cs_member_delete.json,
# docs/decisions/xroad-770-notes.md #11 finding 4): 204, called with the member's
# subsystem record still present, and CASCADES -- the subsystem goes with
# the member. A separate DELETE /subsystems/{subsystem_id} first (the
# earlier own-server notes, #7, paired the two) is redundant and 404s
# subsystem_not_found afterward; do not add it back. There is also no
# GET /subsystems/{id} on the CS at all (405, not 404), which is why the
# probe below reads /clients instead.
DELETE https://{{cs_host}}:4000/api/v1/members/{{xroad_instance}}:{{member_class}}:@MEMBER_CODE@
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{cs_xsrf_token}}

HTTP 204
